⍝ Checked copy of sage1_engine.tinyapl (TinyAPL part), runnable on TinyAPL 0.12.
⍝ Changes from the original, all syntax or semantics of this TinyAPL version:
⍝  - statements are separated with ⋄ (a single newline is whitespace here;
⍝    only a blank line ends a statement), vectors are stranded with ‿ or ⟨⟩;
⍝  - λ θ renamed lam th (not valid names); pairs built with ⍮ instead of ⊂;
⍝  - ⎕math→Arccos returns a complex number, so its real part ℜ is taken;
⍝  - SLERP sum parenthesised: a×u+b×v parsed as a×(u+b×v) right-to-left;
⍝  - SparsePtMul used an undefined p; it now reads (⊂row)⌷⍵, and the Key result is
⍝    scattered back by target index (no indexed assignment in TinyAPL);
⍝  - TinyAPL's ⎕io is 0, so the 1-based CSR/peak fixtures are shifted by 1;
⍝  - ⎕Assert does not exist: Assert prints to stderr and raises a domain error;
⍝  - StateCondition scales the peaks without indexed assignment;
⍝  - FlatPack/QMakeCSR return plain ⟨…⟩ records; LoadWolframPipe is omitted
⍝    (no ⎕JSON / ⎕file→Read in TinyAPL 0.12).
⍝ The Wolfram Language package in the original is not part of this file.
⍝ ============================================================================

Norm2      ← {(+/⍵*2)*0.5}

UnitSphere ← {⍵ ÷ Norm2 ⍵}

ProbDecode ← {⍵×⍵}

Dot        ← {+/⍺×⍵}

Assert     ← {⍵ : ■ 1 ⋄ ⎕E "SAGE-1 assertion failed" ⋄ 'a' + 1}

⍝ ⍺ = u ⍮ v, ⍵ = lam
Slerp ← {u ← UnitSphere ⊃⍺ ⋄ v ← UnitSphere ⊇⍺ ⋄ lam ← ⍵ ⋄
  d ← ¯1 ⌈ 1 ⌊ u Dot v ⋄
  th ← ℜ ⎕math→Arccos d ⋄
  th < 1⏨¯7 : ■ UnitSphere ((1-lam)×u) + lam×v ⋄
  s ← ⎕math→Sin th ⋄
  (((⎕math→Sin (1-lam)×th) ÷ s)×u) + ((⎕math→Sin lam×th) ÷ s)×v}

FlatPack   ← {(⍴⍵) ⍮ ,⍵}

FlatUnpack ← {(⊃⍵) ⍴ ⊇⍵}

⍝ ⍺ = nStates, ⍵ = ⟨row ⋄ col ⋄ w⟩ (1-based) → ⟨n ⋄ row ⋄ col ⋄ w⟩
QMakeCSR ← {⟨⍺ ⋄ ⊃⍵ ⋄ ⊃1↓⍵ ⋄ ⊇⍵⟩}

⍝ ⍺ = ⟨n ⋄ row ⋄ col ⋄ w⟩ (1-based), ⍵ = probability vector p → P^T p
SparsePtMul ← {n ← ⊃⍺ ⋄ row ← (⊃1↓⍺) - 1 ⋄ col ← (⊃2↓⍺) - 1 ⋄ w ← ⊇⍺ ⋄
  contrib ← ((⊂row) ⌷ ⍵) × w ⋄
  val ← col {+/⍵}⌸ contrib ⋄
  idx ← ∪ col ⋄
  {+/ val × idx = ⍵}¨ ⍳ n}

⍝ ⍺ = csr ⍮ lam, ⍵ = x_t
SAGE1Step ← {csr ← ⊃⍺ ⋄ lam ← ⊇⍺ ⋄
  xt  ← UnitSphere ⍵ ⋄
  p   ← ProbDecode xt ⋄
  ptp ← csr SparsePtMul p ⋄
  tgt ← UnitSphere (0 ⌈ ptp)*0.5 ⋄
  xn  ← (xt ⍮ tgt) Slerp lam ⋄
  ok  ← Assert 1⏨¯8 > | 1 - Norm2 xn ⋄
  xn}

DetSelect ← {⊃⍒ ProbDecode ⍵}

⍝ ⍺ = peaks (1-based) ⍮ boost, ⍵ = x_t
StateCondition ← {pks ← (⊃⍺) - 1 ⋄ boost ← ⊇⍺ ⋄
  UnitSphere ⍵ × 1 + (boost - 1) × (⍳ ≢⍵) ∊ pks}

⍝ 5-vertex triangulated patch, as in the original self-test
n   ← 5

row ← 1‿1‿2‿2‿2‿3‿3‿4‿4‿5‿5

col ← 1‿2‿1‿2‿3‿2‿4‿3‿5‿4‿5

w   ← 0.5‿0.5‿0.3‿0.4‿0.3‿0.5‿0.5‿0.5‿0.5‿0.5‿0.5

csr ← n QMakeCSR ⟨row ⋄ col ⋄ w⟩

pks ← 1‿3‿5

x0  ← UnitSphere n ⍴ 1

x1  ← (csr ⍮ 0.35) SAGE1Step x0

x2  ← (csr ⍮ 0.35) SAGE1Step (pks ⍮ 1.25) StateCondition x1

⎕ ← x1

⎕ ← x2

⎕ ← Norm2 x1

⎕ ← Norm2 x2

⎕ ← DetSelect x2
